{
  "tutorial": {
    "id": 4466,
    "version": 2,
    "type": "course",
    "isNew": false,
    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Parameter Fungsi Arrow",
    "descriptionContent": "Pelajari lebih lanjut cara menggunakan fungsi arrow dengan parameter",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17533,
        "title": "Parameter dalam arrow function",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148735,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mari membiasakan diri bekerja dengan arrow function. Untuk itu, kita akan melihat cara menggunakan parameter di dalam arrow function.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" applyDamage = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"damage\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" - (damage);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(applyDamage(\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>damage</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148736,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parameter dalam fungsi arrow mirip dengan parameter dalam fungsi biasa. Buat kode fungsi arrow yang menggunakan <code>score</code> sebagai parameter.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" addBonus = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score + bonus;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(addBonus(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>score</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148737,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dalam arrow function, kita tidak perlu menambahkan tanda kurung jika hanya memiliki satu parameter. Tulis parameter <code>score</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" addBonus = \" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score + bonus;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(addBonus(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148738,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai parameter secara default ditetapkan ke <code>undefined</code>. Jika pemanggilan fungsi tidak meneruskan nilai, fungsi akan menggunakan <code>undefined</code> sebagai nilainya.</p><p>Panggil fungsi <code>healPlayer()</code> di bawah untuk melihatnya menampilkan <code>NaN</code>, yang berarti nilainya tidak terdefinisi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" healPlayer = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"amount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health + amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(healPlayer());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>healPlayer</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148739,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menghindari nilai undefined, kita menentukan nilai default di dalam tanda kurung.</p><p>Tetapkan nilai parameter default di dalam tanda kurung menjadi <code>amount=10</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" healPlayer = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"amount = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health + amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(healPlayer());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>amount</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148740,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menggunakan beberapa parameter, tambahkan parameter baru di dalam tanda kurung dan pisahkan dari parameter lainnya dengan menambahkan koma <code>,</code>.</p><p>Menambahkan parameter default tambahan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" calculateDamage = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"base = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", multiplier = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" base * multiplier;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(calculateDamage());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>multiplier</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148741,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arrow function memungkinkan kita menulis kode yang lebih ringkas dan padat. Cara menulisnya bergantung pada parameter yang digunakan dan ukuran blok kode.</p><p>Fungsi-fungsi ini akan sangat penting nanti saat kita menggunakannya dalam kode yang lebih kompleks, seperti game loop.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" updateScore = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pointsPerCoin = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score + pointsPerCoin;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(updateScore(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148742,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode berikut?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getSpriteName =&gt; sprite {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sprite: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Parameter <code>sprite</code> harus berada setelah <code>=</code> dan sebelum <code>=&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parameter <code>sprite</code> harus berada sebelum tanda kurung <code>()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Parameter <code>sprite</code> harus berada setelah <code>=</code> dan sebelum <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148743,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kita bisa mempersingkat kode berikut?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getDoubleCoins = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"coins\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" coins * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getDoubleCoins(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan menghapus tanda kurung <code>()</code> di sekitar <code>coins</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dengan menghapus kurung kurawal <code>{}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dengan menghapus tanda kurung <code>()</code> di sekitar <code>coins</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148744,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode ini?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scaleDamage = damage,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" multiplier =&gt; damage * multiplier;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(scaleDamage(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tanda kurung di sekitar kedua parameter tidak ada</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak bisa menggunakan beberapa parameter dengan fungsi arrow</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tanda kurung di sekitar kedua parameter tidak ada.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148745,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa output dari kode ini?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getHitRatio = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"hits, shots\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hits / shots;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getHitRatio(\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>40</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148746,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa output dari kode ini?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getHitRatio = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"hits, shots = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hits / shots;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getHitRatio(\" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>20</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>40</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>20</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148747,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa output dari kode ini?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getHitRatio = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"hits, shots = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hits / shots;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getHitRatio(\" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>20</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148748,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi arrow function.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" addDamage = \" /><text value=\"damage\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" - damage;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(addDamage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>damage</code>, dan terakhir <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148749,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tetapkan nilai parameter default ke <code>0</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getLivesLeft = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"lives = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" lives;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getLivesLeft(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>lives</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>0</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148750,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan parameter kedua, <code>maxHealth</code>, ke fungsi arrow dan tetapkan nilai defaultnya ke <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"42\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" healToMax = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"health, maxHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" maxHealth - health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(healToMax(\" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>maxHealth = 100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 148751,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuliskan pemanggilan fungsi yang tepat untuk menampilkan <code>30</code> di konsol.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"30\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getLevelArea = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"length, width = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" length * width;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getLevelArea(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>getLevelArea</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>10</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}